    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Order!</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666060/extras/984a37fb30259d0794cf423b583ce5f1.poster.avif?t=1706108235\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666060/extras/984a37fb30259d0794cf423b583ce5f1.webm?t=1706108235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666060/extras/984a37fb30259d0794cf423b583ce5f1.mp4?t=1706108235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome to Get Order! Where fun has never been this epic. This game brings together four friends in exciting adventures, featuring unique game modes. You and your friends will come together at critical moments to become a real team. Work together to complete incoming orders and build unforgettable memories. Get Order! guarantees entertainment like never before.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666060/extras/a30ceef8f403688d25060c8da7d87027.avif?t=1706108235\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br>\u2022 Computer Orders: Defy technology! Four friends come together to complete rapidly increasing computer orders. Understand the required components, communicate, and assemble them in time by collaborating with your team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666060/extras/85aaf23ac76d32dfdcab1e393cb69eab.avif?t=1706108235\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br>\u2022 Tasty Foods: Master the kitchen! Bring your team together by preparing food orders during busy restaurant hours. You'll need to work together to provide fast and accurate service. Who can serve more efficiently and faster?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666060/extras/a5c3a28ba8401da217f5356a29e05496.avif?t=1706108235\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br>\u2022 Mystery Task (Surprise Mode): The mystery of this mode awaits you! Are you ready to discover Get Order!'s biggest surprise? Guide your team on a secret mission and be prepared for unexpected surprises.<br><br>Get Order! offers the perfect blend of fun and teamwork. Join forces with your friends, overcome challenges, and create unforgettable memories. Get ready to be part of this action-packed and energetic adventure. Discover real fun with Get Order! To learn more about the game and enjoy it, purchase Get Order! on Steam now and embark on enchanting adventures with your friends!",
