serve more efficiently and faster?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666060/extras/a5c3a28ba8401da217f5356a29e05496.avif?t=1706108235\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br>\u2022 Mystery Task (Surprise Mode): The mystery of this mode awaits you! Are you ready to discover Get Order!'s biggest surprise? Guide your team on a secret mission and be prepared for unexpected surprises.<br><br>Get Order! offers the perfect blend of fun and teamwork. Join forces with your friends, overcome challenges, and create unforgettable memories. Get ready to be part of this action-packed and energetic adventure. Discover real fun with Get Order! To learn more about the game and enjoy it, purchase Get Order! on Steam now and embark on enchanting adventures with your friends!",
